,"review_id":"7imKpcFQp-2NHXeRpCtJkA","date":"2020-09-09T20:04:18","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9425014853477478,"text_excerpt":"Amazing Juice place in the CBD area on Union Street. I have literally tried all of their juices. They also have salads and coming out with coffee. I really like the cold pressed juices with the jalepeno and the others with cucumbers. Mr. Big Shot, Mr. Clean, The Model all my faves. The ginger shots area really powerful and give you energy."},{"business_id":"-cDE_lW8Om8w0YIUriXXMg","review_id":"a-6TXwTzCzmYYuts4rxj_A","date":"2020-09-16T18:40:08","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9425014853477478,"text_excerpt":"Completed the 1 day juice cleanse and I'm very happy with how things went. I got my juices delivered and the delivery team were super nice !! I loved that they explained the cleanse to me and also pointed out that I could find directions on their Instagram page. Another touch that I really appreciated was the numbering and labels on the bottles which made the process a whole lot easier for me. My favorite juices and most satisfying to my taste buds were tropical storm and beetnik. They were extremely delicious and had me wanting more. If you looking for a local cleanse company I highly recommend them !!!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"-cDE_lW8Om8w0YIUriXXMg","photo_id":"5PxTZhJFkAXwy58A-lfYYw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/5PxTZhJFkAXwy58A-lfYYw.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
